# Versification "Bible Strong BCC1923": an overlay on Paratext org.vrs, for the Crampon Bible
# (BCC1923).
#
# Crampon numbers as org (LSG), Psalm titles included, except in the chapters below: some follow
# the Vulgate, others join or cut verses its own way. Only the 66 books are described (decided
# 2026-11-27): the additions to Esther (10:4-16:24) and Daniel (3:24-90, 13, 14) have no
# equivalent. Each line was checked against the LSG text (docs/research/versification.md,
# section 2.6).
#
LEV 24:24
DEU 5:30
JOS 21:43
JDG 5:32
1CH 12:40
NEH 7:73
EST 10:13 11:12 12:6 13:18 14:19 15:19 16:24
PSA 18:50 45:17
ECC 7:28
ISA 21:16 38:21
JER 20:17 28:16 37:20
DAN 3:100 13:65 14:42
MAT 17:26
MRK 4:40 8:39 9:49
JHN 11:56
ACT 14:27
1CO 16:23
HEB 13:24
3JN 1:14
#
# Verses cut in two: Leviticus 24:23-24 is org 24:23, Judges 5:31-32 (5:32 "Le pays fut en
# repos pendant quarante ans.") is org 5:31, Nehemiah 7:68-69 (horses and mules, camels and
# asses) is org 7:68.
#! &LEV 24:23-24 = LEV 24:23
#! &JDG 5:31-32 = JDG 5:31
#! &NEH 7:68-69 = NEH 7:68
NEH 7:70-73 = NEH 7:69-72
#
# Deuteronomy 5:17 holds four commandments ("Tu ne tueras point. Tu ne commettras point
# d'adultère. Tu ne déroberas point. Tu ne porteras point de faux témoignage…"), org 5:17-20.
DEU 5:17 = DEU 5:17-20
DEU 5:18-30 = DEU 5:21-33
#
# Joshua 21 has no org 21:36-37 (the cities of Reuben): Crampon 21:36 ("Et de la tribu de Gad:
# la ville de refuge…, Ramoth en Galaad") is org 21:38.
JOS 21:36 = JOS 21:38
JOS 21:37 = JOS 21:38-39
JOS 21:38-43 = JOS 21:40-45
#
# Verses that hold the next one: 1 Chronicles 12:4 (Samaïas…; Jérémie; Jéhéziel…) is org
# 12:4-5, Matthew 17:14 org 17:14-15, Acts 14:6 org 14:6-7, Jeremiah 37:11 org 37:11-12.
1CH 12:4 = 1CH 12:4-5
1CH 12:5-40 = 1CH 12:6-41
MAT 17:14 = MAT 17:14-15
MAT 17:15-26 = MAT 17:16-27
ACT 14:6 = ACT 14:6-7
ACT 14:7-27 = ACT 14:8-28
JER 37:11 = JER 37:11-12
JER 37:12-20 = JER 37:13-21
#
# Last verses that hold the end of their chapter.
PSA 18:50 = PSA 18:50-51
PSA 45:17 = PSA 45:17-18
ISA 21:16 = ISA 21:16-17
ISA 38:21 = ISA 38:21-22
JER 20:17 = JER 20:17-18
JER 28:16 = JER 28:16-17
MRK 4:40 = MRK 4:40-41
JHN 11:56 = JHN 11:56-57
1CO 16:23 = 1CO 16:23-24
HEB 13:24 = HEB 13:24-25
3JN 1:14 = 3JN 1:14-15
#
# Ecclesiastes 7:27 holds 7:28 ("…voici ce que mon âme cherche encore"), so 7:28 is org 7:29.
ECC 7:27 = ECC 7:27-28
ECC 7:28 = ECC 7:29
#
# Mark 9:1 ("Je vous le dis, en vérité, parmi ceux qui sont ici…") is the last verse of Mark 8,
# as in the Vulgate.
MRK 8:39 = MRK 9:1
MRK 9:1-49 = MRK 9:2-50
#
# Esther 1-10:3 is numbered as org; 10:4-16:24 are the Greek additions.
EST 10:4-13 =
EST 11:1-12 =
EST 12:1-6 =
EST 13:1-18 =
EST 14:1-19 =
EST 15:1-19 =
EST 16:1-24 =
#
# Daniel 3:24-90 (the Prayer of Azariah and the Song of the Three), 13 (Susanna) and 14 (Bel and
# the Dragon) are additions; Crampon 3:91-100 ("Alors le roi Nabuchodonosor fut dans la
# stupeur…") is org 3:24-33.
DAN 3:24-90 =
DAN 3:91-100 = DAN 3:24-33
DAN 13:1-65 =
DAN 14:1-42 =
